cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Aabhas: Leakage-Aware Probabilistic Flood Forecasting for Bangladesh"
abstract: >-
  Aabhas is a station-level, probabilistic flood outlook for Bangladesh that
  forecasts the chance a river station crosses its danger level in the next
  24, 48 or 72 hours. It combines a frozen gradient-boosting model (D16),
  leakage-aware validation, cost-derived risk bands, a FastAPI service and a
  bilingual React PWA. It is a research prototype and decision-support tool,
  not an official flood-warning service.
authors:
